/* ---- design tokens ---- */
/* A股约定：红涨绿跌 */
$up: #e5484d;
$down: #2f9e6e;
$flat: #8a8f98;
$warning: #f5a524;
$danger: #e5484d;

/* light theme (P4): uncomment to enable
$up: #dc2626;
$down: #16a34a;
*/

/* colorblind theme: red→red, green→blue
$up: #e5484d;
$down: #3b82f6;
*/

Screen {
    background: $background;
}

/* 顶栏：LogoMark（头像）+ TopBar（两行品牌 / 状态） */
#header {
    dock: top;
    height: 3;
    background: $surface;
    border-bottom: solid $foreground 12%;
}

TopBar {
    width: 1fr;
    height: 2;
    color: $text-muted;
    padding: 0 2 0 0;
}

/* 主区：左对话 + 右侧面板（SidePanel 自带 DEFAULT_CSS） */
#main {
    height: 1fr;
}

ChatView {
    width: 1fr;
    height: 1fr;
}

#chat-log {
    height: 1fr;
    padding: 1 1 0 1;
    scrollbar-size-vertical: 1;
}

/* 输入行：› 提示符 + 输入框，外框随焦点变主色（设计稿输入框） */
#prompt-row {
    height: 3;
    border: round $foreground 30%;
    margin: 0 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

#prompt-row:focus-within {
    border: round $accent;
}

#prompt-caret {
    width: 2;
    color: $accent;
}

ChatInput {
    height: 1;
    border: none;
    background: $background;
    padding: 0;
}

ChatInput:focus {
    border: none;
}

/* HintBar：输入框上方浮层（/ 命令菜单 · @ 候选 · 单行提示） */
HintBar {
    height: auto;
    max-height: 12;
    padding: 0 2;
    color: $text-muted;
}

HintBar.-idle {
    display: none;
}

HintBar.-menu {
    color: $text;
    background: $surface;
    border: round $foreground 20%;
    margin: 0 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

/* ToolIndicator：dexter 风格工具调用指示 */
ToolIndicator {
    height: auto;
    padding: 0 1;
    margin: 0 0 1 0;
}

ToolIndicator .ti-header {
    height: 1;
    color: $text;
}

ToolIndicator .ti-detail {
    height: 1;
    padding-left: 2;
    color: $text-muted;
}

/* 展开详情（点击/Enter 切换）：默认隐藏 */
ToolIndicator .ti-more {
    display: none;
    padding: 0 0 0 4;
    color: $text-muted;
}

ToolIndicator.-expanded .ti-more {
    display: block;
}

ToolIndicator.-expanded {
    background: $surface-darken-1;
}

/* ConfirmBar：内联写操作确认（等待决定时黄框高亮） */
ConfirmBar {
    height: auto;
    border: round $warning;
    padding: 0 2;
    margin: 1 1 1 1;
}

ConfirmBar.-pending {
    background: $surface-darken-1;
}

ConfirmBar .cb-body {
    width: 1fr;
}

/* WorkingIndicator：思考中 spinner / 重试态 */
WorkingIndicator {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.turn-stats {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.interrupted-line {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.memory-receipt {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.resume-omitted {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
    margin: 1 0 0 0;
}

.resume-banner {
    height: 1;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.hint-card {
    border: round $warning;
    color: $text-muted;
    padding: 1 2;
    margin: 1 0;
}

.workflow-card {
    border-left: thick $accent;
    padding: 0 0 0 1;
    margin: 0 0 1 0;
}

/* 对话消息 */
.user-msg {
    background: $panel;
    border-left: outer $foreground 30%;
    padding: 0 1;
    margin: 0 0 1 0;
    color: $text;
}

/* 回答：⏺ 栏 + 正文（设计稿 flex gap，折行悬挂缩进） */
.answer-row {
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 4 1 0;
    padding: 0 1;
}

.answer-dot {
    width: 2;
    height: 1;
}

.assistant-msg {
    width: 1fr;
    max-width: 110;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
}

/* 设计稿：工具结果卡片只是缩进的细框，不抢正文 */
.card {
    border: round $foreground 20%;
    padding: 0 1;
    margin: 0 0 1 2;
    height: auto;
    width: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
}


/* 启动欢迎卡 */
.welcome-card {
    border: round $accent;
    padding: 0 1;
    margin: 0 0 1 0;
    max-width: 88;
    height: auto;
}

/* 首启引导卡（未配置 AI 时） */
.onboarding-card {
    border: round $accent;
    padding: 1 2;
    margin: 1 0;
    height: auto;
}

/* ThinkingBlock：推理模型思考过程 */
ThinkingBlock {
    height: auto;
    padding: 0 1;
}

ThinkingBlock .th-header {
    height: 1;
}

ThinkingBlock .th-body {
    padding: 0 0 0 2;
    margin: 0 0 1 0;
    color: $text-muted;
}

ThinkingBlock.-expanded {
    background: $surface-darken-1;
}

/* 回答里的表格：设计稿是紧凑细网格（缩进、按内容宽、表头淡色底），
   覆盖 Textual Markdown 默认的整宽 + 行间空行 */
.assistant-msg MarkdownTable {
    width: auto;
    margin: 0 0 1 2;
    background: transparent;
}

.assistant-msg MarkdownTableContent {
    grid-gutter: 0 1;
    keyline: thin $foreground 15%;
}

.assistant-msg MarkdownTableContent > .header {
    color: $text-muted;
    background: $panel;
}

/* 滚动条：设计稿是贴边的细淡条，不抢眼 */
#chat-log, #timeline {
    scrollbar-color: $foreground 20%;
    scrollbar-color-hover: $foreground 35%;
    scrollbar-color-active: $accent;
    scrollbar-background: $background;
    scrollbar-background-hover: $background;
    scrollbar-background-active: $background;
}
